WEBVTT

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:33.030
What a great feeling.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:35.970
With the heart of a fish, a ninja entrusts his body to water.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:37.770
With the heart of a bird, he entrusts his body to the wind.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.210
The Shinobis, 18th installment:

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:41.970
"The Zoo which Creeps in the Darkness."

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.270
That's what Denzou-san said, but...

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.650
leaving it to the wind like this,

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:49.380
it's like I've really become a bird.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:49.780
Huh?

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:51.920
But birds...

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.750
Stay away!

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:07.470
Himawari?

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:12.600
Just like always, huh?

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.110
Quite magnificent skill, even if I do say so myself.

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:24.780
I'm falling...

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:24.780
That's pretty careless.

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:27.220
Oh my...

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:31.060
That girl. How many times does she have to do this?

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:32.710
Geez...

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:35.560
They'll say she just can't learn.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.360
A kite these days?

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.500
Even among ninjas they aren't popular.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.570
She really needs looking after.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:48.840
Himawari?

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.650
Hinata Himawari

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:00.590
makes her appearance!

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:02.550
That girl...

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.650
Your entrance has become more fitting for a student of Shinobi High.

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:11.060
Even I won't repeat the same mistake twice.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.480
Fixing this is going to be a lot of trouble.

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.850
Hayato already said it, but kites aren't popular these days.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:30.080
I agree with you on that.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.350
Something terrible has happened!

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:33.350
What is it? You're not even wearing your uniform.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:35.350
According to my information...

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:37.260
Actually, I've seen it with my own eyes.

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.220
The boy's school went up in flames and has burned down!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.100
Calm down.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:53.970
What do you mean?

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:57.210
Even I don't really know what's going on.

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.710
So, how many injuries?

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:02.210
As for that, no matter how hard I've looked, there wasn't anyone there.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.280
They are excellent reserve ninjas.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.290
There's no way they were too slow and got trapped.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:10.460
When I heard the sound of an explosion I went to investigate right away.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.320
There wasn't even the shadow of one person. It doesn't make sense.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:14.320
An explosion?

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:14.830
Even more so...

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.830
I was supposed to be at the boy's dormitory last night.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:25.200
"Show your face for the opening of the new student's welcome party."

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:28.170
This letter came directly from Kouchou-sensei.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.970
I completely forgot about it.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.410
When I rushed over there at dawn...

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:34.850
You said you heard the sound of an explosion and went straight there to investigate, right?

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:35.520
Yeah.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:40.220
If that's the case, the male students must have already gone before the explosion happened.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:41.390
That's what I think.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.620
Amazing. This is really amazing.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.900
This was a timed explosion, huh?

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.970
I wish I could have seen the moment of the explosion.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:59.110
Himeji, you joke too much.

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:00.110
Joke?

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:03.910
My favorite thing is blowing things into smithereens!

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:17.290
Nasu-2?!

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.390
What's he doing?

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.630
Does he intend to destroy it even more?

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:21.830
Let's crush him.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:27.690
Stop it! Hey!

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:28.970
I give in! I give in!

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:30.770
That's...

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:32.370
Hayato-dono.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.240
That idiot.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:39.750
Hayato-dono, why were you doing that?

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.750
I was asked by Principal Yatsugashira.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.790
By Principal Yatsugashira?!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:46.750
What does that mean?

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:49.790
The boy's school has been closed down.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.850
I was told to come down afterwards.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.460
I haven't heard about the school being shut down.

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:58.330
There is no way that we can tell you high school girls every little thing, right?

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.500
I'm a student from the boy's school too!

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.640
Oh, so you are a guy.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:05.370
Anyway, I thought I was helping out.

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:07.140
Tempted by money, right?

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:09.340
13,000 yen daily.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:11.160
Hayato-dono.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.540
Looks like it would be faster to hear about this from the principal directly.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:19.820
It's as Marikouji-sensei says.

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:23.220
See?

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.960
Even though they disappeared suddenly,

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:34.170
the boy's school students have returned to where they're supposed to be.

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:35.570
That's all there is to it.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.300
But why did they suddenly close it down?

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:43.010
There's no need for me to tell you that.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.680
The boy's school has been abolished,

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.850
that truth alone is enough.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.900
But if the boy's school has been shut down, that means

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:57.860
the girl's school is going to be shut down eventually too, right?

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:01.360
That means it has something to do with us, right?

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:04.230
Just when I was finally able to become a student of this school...

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:07.370
and I'm finally getting used to this school's ninja training.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.470
If this school is closed down too, I-

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:13.710
We understand, sorry for making a fuss.

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:15.010
But Shikimi-san!

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.740
It's fine, let's go Himawari.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:18.940
W-Why? Why?

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:20.580
Don't make a big fuss, just go.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.580
The discussion still hasn't finished yet!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:21.880
Sorry for intruding.

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:24.590
But... Everyone... Wait... I'm not done yet!

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:32.890
Everyone, are you okay with that?

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:35.460
Are you going to give up that easily?

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.460
There was a wiretap.

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:42.460
But, there's no way that Principal Yatsugashira wouldn't notice such a thing, right?

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.470
That means...

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:46.760
She might be one of them, right?

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:53.950
It seems we've been noticed.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:58.950
As expected of the reserve ninjas your people raised.

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:03.330
It appears those girls could hinder our plan.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.420
I'll leave it to your judgment.

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:35.390
As intended, carrying out the plan.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:40.180
Yeah, yeah. I heard you.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.170
I'll proceed with the plan as intended.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:48.030
My own plan that is.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:50.690
Now...

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.810
Spider web it is?

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:06.280
All right, let's start with the yellow one.

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:14.490
This will be your treat!

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:18.500
Sponging off your students in spite of being a teacher.

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:21.790
Don't say bad things like "sponging off," please.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:26.090
That's right, you said you won't forgive me if I destroy the school.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:28.500
But it's part of my job,

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.510
so I can't help it if it bothers you.

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:34.400
But we might be able to grasp some kind of clue from the ruins of the fire.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.870
Oh, this looks like it's fried just right.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:40.790
After all, you can never fool the principal.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:43.440
Is my seafood mix ready yet?

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.520
Mine was pork, egg, and cheese.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.460
Coming right now.

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.030
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.720
This is the seafood mix.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.230
This is the pork, egg, and cheese.

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:57.660
Yay! It's pork, egg, and cheese.

00:10:57.660 --> 00:10:58.600
Wait.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.460
I don't recognize your face.

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:03.830
I'm only here part time, got a problem with that?

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:06.870
This kind of customer service isn't appreciated.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.340
What an irritating guy.

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:14.540
Now, now. Once you eat, you'll feel better.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.890
First off, you need to eat some of the okonomiyaki.

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:22.620
It's odd for Nanafushi and Komurasaki to disappear so quietly in the first place.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:25.130
They didn't even say goodbye to the ones they like.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.690
There's nothing really between Nanafushi and me.

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:34.140
It'd be a different thing if this time he disappeared against his own will.

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.060
It's fried, Hayato-dono.

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:39.330
Let's eat!

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.520
Let's see, that big one over there...

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:44.010
From here to here is mine.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.670
Stingy!

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:47.340
What?

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:49.150
That food you just gave me had poison in it.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:52.120
Hey, now I'm really pissed.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.620
What's going on?

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:59.050
Denzou-san's face is splitting.

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:22.940
I'm hungry.

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:26.090
I wonder if there's anything to eat in the cafeteria's refrigerator.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:26.560
Huh?

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.910
Training in the middle of the night?

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:31.600
That's Himawari!

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:33.020
Himawari!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.160
Hey you, wait!

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.290
What are you going to do with Himawari?

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.600
Ouch...

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.620
Just now, did you hear someone calling out, "Himawari"?

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.950
This sugary scent, where have I smelled it before?

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.620
It was the guy we met at Monjaya!

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:08.380
Shikimi-chan, what are you doing? This is an emergency!

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.510
You, falling for Hayato? What a surprise.

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:13.610
Don't say stupid things.

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:16.280
I smell a hypnotic in his mouth.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:18.250
I was careless.

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:22.560
It was most likely mixed into the okonomiyaki that Hayato and Himawari ate.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.060
Pull yourself together.

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:26.960
Here's some restorative medicine.

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:33.070
What happened to Himawari?

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:35.330
What about her?

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.760
She was taken away by someone.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:41.580
When I tried to go after him, my eyes suddenly got heavy and my strength drained away.

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:46.340
The restorative medicine alone was enough, you went overboard...

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:51.620
Momota, follow this scent and take us to where they took Himawari.

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:58.190
It stinks.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:00.800
Wouldn't the scent's trail fade away like this?

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:03.660
Momota's nose isn't that weak.

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:10.140
At least show me your position so I can see where to run!

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:13.640
Where am I?

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.880
Are you awake?

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:21.180
You're that guy from Monjaya.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:22.880
What are you going to do with me?

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:25.550
Why are you trying so hard?

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:30.930
That's because I have an important mission, to protect my master.

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:33.660
What an obedient fool.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:37.030
Ninjas are always "master, master."

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:39.500
They can't decide anything on their own.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:41.800
That kind of thing is really annoying.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:00.290
I... can't move.

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.820
It's better if you don't move too much.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:06.160
You'll only be wasting your strength.

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:11.100
Now, next is...

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:17.170
Want me to show you?

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.400
No way! Shikimi-san too?!

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:25.510
Momota's nose isn't really that great, huh?

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:26.850
That's not possible.

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:29.910
Momota, what's wrong? Where is Himawari?

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:33.550
No matter how you look at it, Himawari isn't here.

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:40.830
The next target is you.

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:41.960
You are...!

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.300
What are you doing?

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:49.970
Shikimi!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.510
Don't worry about me, get that guy!

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:54.240
You're full of spirit...

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.470
What an insatiable brat.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.940
What's with that physical ability?

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:06.190
He's not human!

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:10.320
Let's see, who am I going to attack next?

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.660
Oh, it's this one.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:19.160
Look.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.100
Hayato... Suka?

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.000
What is "Suka"?

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.240
It means that you're just a boring opponent.

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:29.210
Bye bye.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:39.220
Hayato-dono!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.920
H-Himawari, are you okay?

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:43.060
Hayato-dono, are you okay?

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:45.960
Tsukiyohime.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:47.600
When did you get here?

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:51.630
If you're here, do something besides eating.

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:54.400
It's an opponent even Shikimi and the others can't stand against.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.070
He's all flexible like rubber.

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:58.470
Anyways, he's a monster.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:00.200
That monster you speak of is a human child.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:03.840
At this time... a miso soup illusion?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:09.120
What I'm going to show you looks like an illusion, but it's not an illusion.

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:13.090
This is a vision of one's heart reflected on the surface.

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:39.440
Wait!

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:40.610
Hold up!

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:47.790
What is it?

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:47.790
Idiot.

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:52.290
It's crumbled, whatcha gonna do now?

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:03.970
So that sort of thing happened?

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.570
But what are we supposed to do with this?

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:09.540
I only showed you the things that rose to the surface.

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:13.880
A three-year old's spirit lasts until a hundred, that's the motive.

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:16.650
Evil's reward is at the point of a needle.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:36.300
What?

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:39.070
You... How did you...

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:40.440
Everyone!

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:44.580
Oh well. This time I'll put an end to all this for sure.

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:47.050
Tormenting others for your own pleasure...

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:47.940
You're a disgrace to ninjas!

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:54.790
You laughed at me, saying I'm being used by my master and can't decide anything by myself, right?

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:57.390
So? What about it?

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.360
Hey, Himawari...

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:05.130
Himawari stop!

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:08.100
But, that's not right!

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:09.660
Don't get any closer to him!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:11.270
T-This is an order from your master!

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:12.410
Will you please shut up!

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:13.140
Yes...

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:17.310
If it's for the sake of protecting my master...

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:19.780
I sometimes disobey my master's orders too!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:26.290
Because I'm the one who decided to protect Hayato-sama.

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:31.990
Right now, the important thing is that I understand for myself what I have to do.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:33.860
But you're different!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:37.830
Without that gumball machine you can't decide anything, can you?

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.430
W-What are you doing?!

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:14.500
The one who can't decide a thing on their own is you.

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:15.600
Shut up!

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:19.270
I won't... I won't take orders!

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:38.960
Stop it! Stop it!

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:40.220
Himawari!

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:41.550
Hayato-dono!

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.500
Go to hell!

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:53.710
I, Hinata Himawari, will risk my life to protect my master!

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:54.610
Himawari.

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:57.680
If that's the case, then go together to the other world!

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:07.760
Now!

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:24.570
Himawari!

00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:36.290
There you go.

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:38.820
It's awfully big today.

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:42.160
It's my thanks for getting rid of that conceited brat.

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:45.730
In that case, this okonomiyaki belongs to Himawari, right?

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:47.590
Is that a reward?

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:49.960
It includes you too.

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:50.980
Huh?

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:54.070
What's wrong Himawari?

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:57.910
That kid, why was he targeting us?

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:00.040
It was a game.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:01.880
That weak minded guy.

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:06.080
He learned an excellent technique, he was just showing off.

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:10.920
Well, for that brat's sake too, it was good that he lost to Himawari.

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:12.590
Is that so?

00:22:12.590 --> 00:22:14.920
By the way, why are you here?

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:18.030
Being treated to a feast.

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:21.030
You're a teacher and yet you're getting treated by your students...

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:25.600
Shikimi-san, we're not treating him.

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:30.500
If this okonomiyaki is mine, then my things are my master's things.

00:22:32.110 --> 00:22:33.540
Hey, see that?

00:22:34.640 --> 00:22:35.650
Pathetic.

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:38.850
Hey, that's still cooking isn't it?

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:38.840
Isn't it fine.

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:41.210
That's too much, Hayato-dono.

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:45.360
Testing out our experiment and eliminating the obstacles in the way.

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:48.850
I thank you for killing two birds with one stone.

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:51.360
It's meaningless if we don't make any progress.

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:54.020
I'll be looking forward to that.

00:24:12.340 --> 00:24:15.710
Shikimi-san found an unfamiliar herb in the forest.

00:24:15.710 --> 00:24:19.480
What was that? What a wicked and weird scream!

00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:21.400
Don't tell me... That grass talked?!

00:24:21.850 --> 00:24:23.020
Walked? Jumped? Struggled?

00:24:25.760 --> 00:24:30.230
And also, who exactly are the ninjas that Shikimi-san fears?

00:24:31.200 --> 00:24:32.060
Next time:

00:24:32.060 --> 00:24:34.170
"If you eat the grass, you'll eat the poison as well."

00:24:34.830 --> 00:24:38.040
Hayato-dono, don't eat that grass!
